      "source_text": "请对劲敌们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ed748702a6491cfe604801b5ea9e6b2c41f1e94595cf3b9a87dd8692d7ffa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "677"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7b9d68fb24242c5be79fbbb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对崇拜你的后辈们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80104f428486dfeef057f8e3e5976abc0ac50ec4b3c3ebcef5272c06843d1dca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "678"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5451571d247a1771b6550b00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望我们在竞赛中关注哪些地方呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd7849ced480e4b1bd51f95942cca0e61df706efa0e533508ea511763c39c22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "679"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f6493a42dbb062eaa645381",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对BNW的那2人有什么看法？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da39ae64643e7b4bdc697865623ba9e69dc305ec99a9f8598d9b0bb8a9e0f6bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
